        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5F5E5A;verticalAlign=middle;" value="Solo OSINT-only CTI pipeline: Ravenor collector → Google Drive corpus → Claude synthesis → staging draft → distribution template → SLTT audience. Each stage: inputs, outputs, touchpoints (where you adjust it), technologies, status.">
